  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at a point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Thus, for continuity of the given function, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Now, using the standard limits&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
